    <div class="founder-bio">
      <p>Web Convert Pro was founded by Levi Lindsay, a marketing and business development professional with experience working across multiple sectors of the business world.</p>
      <p>After spending years working in marketing and technology-driven companies, Levi developed a strong understanding of what it takes to attract customers, communicate value, and turn interest into business.</p>
      <p>His experience spans digital marketing, content creation, sales, and customer relations. Working across these different areas has given him a unique perspective on business — not just how to market a product or service, but how to understand the customer, identify what they actually need, and build something that delivers on those expectations.</p>
      <p>Eventually, Levi decided it was time to take that experience and build something of his own.</p>
      <p>That decision led to Web Convert Pro.</p>
      <p>His philosophy is straightforward: listen first, understand the vision, and build something worth being proud of. Rather than pushing generic packages or unnecessary services, Levi believes in creating practical solutions that make sense for each individual business.</p>
      <p>When you work with Web Convert Pro, you're not just another project. You're a business with a vision, and we're here to help bring it to life.</p>
